{"id":"de_funt","lemma":"défunt","pos":"adj","rank":4471,"glosses":["(of a person) late, deceased","(of a place, era etc.) which is dead and gone, bygone","defunct"],"ipa":"/de.fœ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7a/Fr-d%C3%A9funt.ogg/Fr-d%C3%A9funt.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"défunte","masculinePlural":"défunts","femininePlural":"défuntes"},"formAudio":{"défunte":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-d%C3%A9funte.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Son défunt mari était violoniste.","en":"Her late husband was a violinist.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/29011","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},null,{"g":"husband"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"violinist"}]},{"text":"Je pense souvent à ma défunte mère.","en":"I often think of my dead mother.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"often"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},null,{"g":"mother"}]},{"text":"Il a vengé son père défunt.","en":"He avenged his dead father.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to avenge","l":"venger"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"father"},null]},{"text":"Il chérissait le souvenir de sa défunte femme.","en":"He cherished the memory of his dead wife.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"memory"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his"},null,{"g":"woman"}]},{"text":"C’est un portrait de mon défunt père.","en":"This is a portrait of my late father.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"portrait"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"father"}]}]}